          "ds:atmosMisc": "hybrid sigma-pressure coordinate system",
          "ds:atmosShortwaveRadiationScheme": "Morcrette et al. (1986) with modifications for additional greenhouse gases, 14.6 μm band of ozone and various types of aerosols. Continuum absorption after Giorgetta and Wild (1995).",
